OL,3,GNEWSAPowerhouse stadium to be built
OL,4,Awith bricks from former hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FBricks from a Birmingham hospital that
OL,7,Fstood for more than a century are being
OL,8,Fsalvaged for a major regeneration
OL,9,Fscheme.
OL,11,FBirmingham City Football Club have
OL,12,Fbought one million bricks, which
OL,13,Fspecialists have cleaned, sorted and
OL,14,Frestored from the former City Hospital.
OL,16,FThey will be used to build the
OL,17,FPowerhouse stadium in the city's
OL,18,Fplanned Sports Quarter, replacing
OL,19,Fmaterials removed after the hospital's
OL,20,Fclosure.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
